tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                            <td class=\"p-10\"><a href=\"/fan-motor\" class=\"font-black border-b-4 border-green-500 text-blue-800\">Industrial Fan Motor Repair</a></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-10 font-black text-2xl\">₹6,500+</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-10 font-bold\">12 Months Protection</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                            <td class=\"p-10\"><a href=\"/cooling-coils\" class=\"font-black border-b-4 border-green-500 text-blue-800\">Chemical Deep Coil Cleaning</a></td>\n                            <td class=\"p-10 font-black text-2xl\">₹2,850+</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-10 font-bold\">Efficiency Restore</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ (Blue & Green Accents) -->\n    <section class=\"section-padding bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-center text-black uppercase\">Technical <span class=\"blue-text\">AHU Insights</span> FAQ</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-8 mt-20\">\n                <div class=\"p-10 bg-slate-50 rounded-[3rem] border-l-8 border-green-600 shadow-lg\">\n                    <p class=\"text-2xl font-black text-black mb-4 uppercase\">How frequently do I need <span class=\"blue-text\">AHU Services Ahmedabad</span>?</p>\n                    <p class=\"text-lg opacity-80\">For industries in <b>Vatva</b> and <b>Naroda</b>, quarterly servicing is vital. Regular <b>AHU Services Ahmedabad</b> ensure that focus keywords like &#8220;mechanical efficiency&#8221; and &#8220;purity&#8221; are maintained.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-10 bg-slate-50 rounded-[3rem] border-l-8 border-blue-600 shadow-lg\">\n             